{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch1rjEZ24ehbzpdYb1LSo", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I signed off, but with low confidence (0.4). I filed two reports, and only the first was confirmed by the developer.\n\n- **Budget sheet, Spent (confirmed):** it shows $80, but history totals $60 (40 Groceries plus 20 Rent). The recurring Rent is counted twice. This also halves the daily amount to $0.95. After I added a $1 expense, Spent read $81 instead of $61.\n- **Main screen number pad (not confirmed):** tapping 1, ., 5, 2 shows $1.52, and tapping 7 then changes it to $1.53 instead of ignoring the extra digit. I reproduced it twice, but the developer replied \"could not reproduce with the steps given\" both times.\n\nAdding a new category (\"Fun\") from the main screen worked, and a $1 expense in it showed up in history.\n\nI did not test:\n- Editing or deleting history entries.\n- Renaming or deleting categories.\n- Rotating the screen.\n- Whether data survives an app restart.\n\nI also never found a dedicated category management screen, so the \"categories loaded from the database on open\" change is untested.\n\nI left the \"Fun\" category and the $1 expense in the app's data."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 339, "cache_read_input_tokens": 45149, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 339}, "output_tokens": 387, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "b9fbcf63-8820-46c4-961d-c0666ce16cb1", "uuid": "6c1124f7-4813-42ca-aab7-3d66af8889fe", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T00:16:31.415Z", "request_id": "req_011Ch1rjELczxmLgm3ktaznR"}
